  "id": "com.github.phillip9933.opencloud-document-workflow.document-workflow",
  "name": "Document Workflow",
  "subtitle": "Review and automatically file documents in OpenCloud.",
  "description": "PDF Inbox, local OCR, optional AI suggestions, fields, tags and review or automatic filing. Original files and permissions stay in OpenCloud. Requires the companion service: an administrator installs the matching Docker kit once per instance. The store ZIP alone installs only the frontend. The kit bundles Node, Poppler, Tesseract and OCR data; conversion is optional. Use an OpenCloud App Token for unattended work. Independent community app, tested on OpenCloud 9.",
